<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-thompson1917-t1917-032-code-traceability> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Thompson (1917) T1917-032 — teeth & tusks: differential-accretion log spiral + St Venant torsion — Code-to-model traceability: 90/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-28"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Module header maps E1-E9 to Thompson pages and to the four Lean laws and lists the Pass 2 additions; every function docstring names its equation and, where applicable, the Lean declaration; KG yaml code_locus / lean_locus pass `verify_integrity.py` and `check_lean_formula_alignment.py`." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-code-traceability> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/claude-fable-5-1> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/code-traceability" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-thompson1917-t1917-032-code-traceability-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-thompson1917-t1917-032-code-traceability-2> ;
    pk:hasScore 9e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-thompson1917-t1917-032-model-fidelity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Thompson (1917) T1917-032 — teeth & tusks: differential-accretion log spiral + St Venant torsion — Model fidelity to source: 90/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-28"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "E1-E3 (`log_spiral_r`, `whorl_expansion`, `gnomon_radius`, L146-L165), E4-E6 screw accretion with an optional measured-width profile (`grow_tooth`, `implied_psi_deg`, L190-L235), E8-E9 St Venant warping (L238-L277), E7 helix (L281-L296) are implemented as published; the twisted model Thompson invokes for long tusks is now fitted to the specimen in a nested 2 × 2 design (`fit_screw_model`, `compare_screw_models`, L542-L611) and the E5 closure is verified against the integrated accretion ODE (`integrate_accretion_spiral`, S4: r = 1.000). 17 Lean theorems mirror the four laws (0 sorry)." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-model-fidelity> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/claude-fable-5-1> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/model-fidelity" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-thompson1917-t1917-032-model-fidelity-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-thompson1917-t1917-032-model-fidelity-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-thompson1917-t1917-032-model-fidelity-3>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-thompson1917-t1917-032-model-fidelity-4> ;
    pk:hasScore 9e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-thompson1917-t1917-032-morphometric-validation> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Thompson (1917) T1917-032 — teeth & tusks: differential-accretion log spiral + St Venant torsion — Morphometric validation: 86/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-28"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "`measure_morphoeval()` (L1223-L1249) returns 17 measurements: log-spiral r = 0.989 (bootstrap CI 0.984-0.998) and RMSE 36.8 px vs circle 41.8 px vs Archimedean 123.6 px; ψ = 36.9° (CI 34.7-40.1°); Spearman ρ(|κ|, 1/w) = −0.18 with block-shuffled-width permutation p = 0.80 (accretion coupling rejected); screw-fit RMSEs with ΔAIC for twist (477, 355) and the τ = 0 ablation ratio 1.62; narwhal α ≡ 70.2° (z = +1.00 vs Kiladze & Chernova 2018 Table 1, inside the published 58.8-72.8° range), φ bootstrap CI, tan α vs 1/d slope with CI; St Venant sector count = 6 (reference 6) with circular-section null = 0; sweep S4 r = 1.000; one-sample KS normality p < 0.001 reported honestly as systematic misfit." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-morphometric-validation> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/claude-fable-5-1> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/morphometric-validation" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-thompson1917-t1917-032-measurement-circle-null-rmse-px>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-thompson1917-t1917-032-measurement-cv-kappa-w-accretion-law>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-thompson1917-t1917-032-measurement-kappa-sign-changes>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-thompson1917-t1917-032-measurement-ks-pvalue-spiral-residual-normality>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-thompson1917-t1917-032-measurement-log-spiral-pearson-r>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-thompson1917-t1917-032-measurement-log-spiral-psi-deg>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-thompson1917-t1917-032-measurement-log-spiral-rmse-px>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-thompson1917-t1917-032-measurement-narwhal-alpha-equiv-deg>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-thompson1917-t1917-032-measurement-narwhal-tan-alpha-equiv>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-thompson1917-t1917-032-measurement-narwhal-tan-alpha-vs-inv-d-slope>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-thompson1917-t1917-032-measurement-narwhal-z-alpha>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-thompson1917-t1917-032-measurement-screw-fit-rmse-const-width-twisted-px>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-thompson1917-t1917-032-measurement-screw-fit-rmse-measured-width-twisted-px>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-thompson1917-t1917-032-measurement-spearman-abs-kappa-vs-inv-width>,
